Quest 130 "Rotten Eye"
    Journal for karus "You have promised [Moradon Merchant] Shymer to bring her Rotten Eye."
    Journal for elmorad "You have promised [Moradon Merchant] Clark to bring him Rotten Eye."
    Collect 3 of 379274000

